# Search

`SearchBar.vue` is the Quran search. `useAutoComplete.js` builds suggestions. `filterWords` groups results.

The تشكيل checkbox shows vowels in the suggestion menu and in the result chips.

Root matching still uses the plain word. Strip vowels with `normalizeWord` before `filterWords` when تشكيل is on. In `groupResults`, compare the stripped form to the root derivatives so vocalized chips stay in the root group.

Clicking the search box while it has text must reopen suggestions (`openSuggestions`). Picking a suggestion searches the plain value.

`fetchWordRoot("قل")` returns قلل because the first stored root wins. Do not change that unless asked.

Do not fold dagger alif into ا in suggestions.
